(Normalization Worked Example) Tj T*
(Consider Enrollment\(student_id, course_id, student_name, course_name, grade\).) Tj T*
(The composite key is \(student_id, course_id\). Student_name depends only on student_id.) Tj T*
(Course_name depends only on course_id. Split into Student, Course, and Enrollment tables.) Tj T*
(The split removes partial dependencies and avoids repeating names in every enrollment row.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
