(Functional Dependencies) Tj T*
(A functional dependency X determines Y means each value of X is associated with one value of Y.) Tj T*
(For example student_id determines student_name in a Student relation.) Tj T*
(A candidate key is a minimal set of attributes that functionally determines all attributes.) Tj T*
(Partial dependencies and transitive dependencies help identify violations of normal forms.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
