(SQL Joins) Tj T*
(An INNER JOIN returns rows with matching keys in both tables.) Tj T*
(A LEFT JOIN returns all rows from the left table plus matched rows from the right table.) Tj T*
(A RIGHT JOIN returns all rows from the right table plus matched rows from the left table.) Tj T*
(Use an ON clause to state the join condition, such as Student.id = Enrollment.student_id.) Tj T*
ET
